  "mn135:10.4": "The text switches from <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vaṇṇavanta</i> (“beautiful”, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn135/en/sujato#3.4'>MN 135:3.4</a>) to <i lang='pi' translate='no'>pāsādika</i> (“lovely”). ",
